  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Veterans Evaluation Services obligated $1.7B in federal contract dollars in FY2026 to date. Veterans Evaluation Services won 25 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $66.3M. Veterans Evaluation Services obligations are down 18.5% year over year. Veterans Evaluation Services obligations have varied across recent fiscal years: $617M in FY21, $691M in FY22, $693M in FY23, $1.1B in FY24, $2B in FY25, and $1.7B in FY26. Current-year totals are partial (fiscal year to date). Veterans Evaluation Services shows concentration in a relatively small number of large awards given the $66.3M average award size and the 25 awards recorded so far. Use these headline figures to compare Veterans Evaluation Services to peers, to assess award size and concentration, and to flag FY25 as the largest-obligation year in the available series.",
